<title>UK: Nordrhein-Westfalen adds 300 mln Dem to 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Nordrhein-Westfalen adds 300 mln Dem to 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDRHEIN-WESTFALEN</p>
<p> AMT    *800 MLN DEM  COUPON     **4.60    MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.15    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     LISTING    DDF FFM   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 500 MLN MARKS LAUNCHED 06.FEB.95</p>
<p>	     **LINKED TO THE REX 10 YEAR INDEX TIMES 81.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA+/=     DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
